                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A locomotive, usually for use on a railway, that is powered by steam."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc030a61-e4ac-4068-857f-505ed67e7f22",
                                                "sense_id": "74fbd222-fbca-3f5a-8412-ebaa0401e9df",
                                                "text": "Inevitably the present extent and variety of the Belgian railways will diminish, and within the space of the ten-year plan we can expect to see a modern system concentrated on the main traffic routes like its neighbour in the Netherlands, and with its last steam locomotives and wooden coaches honourably retired to the museum."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
